{
  "name": "rose-pine",
  "label": "Rosé Pine",
  "source": "https://github.com/rose-pine/rose-pine-theme",
  "license": "MIT",
  "light": {
    "variant": "Dawn",
    "notes": "bg base, paper surface, chip overlay, border highlight med, border-hover highlight high; text from the neovim palette file (older ports carry #575279); primary rose, red love, green pine, amber and yellow gold, blue foam, purple iris. red, blue, and purple are darkened two, seven, and five points of lightness so white ink reads 4.5 on them. gold (amber and yellow) is lightened four so the text ink does. The roles derived from the four stay pinned to the published values (MAD-378)",
